[[Image:Westbrook Garrison (interior).jpg|thumb|300px|The garrison's interior.]]
'''Westbrook Garrison''' is a barracks of the [[Stormwind Guard]] located in [[Forest's Edge]] on the western end of [[Elwynn Forest]], near the border with [[Westfall]], which is controlled by agents of the [[Defias Brotherhood]] and their dreaded mechanical [[harvest golem]]s.

Because of the corruption and political instability caused in the kingdom by [[Lady Katrana Prestor]], the Westbrook Garrison lives through difficult times where they have to deal with an increasing [[gnoll]] and thief activity coming from Westfall. With the bulk of the Stormwind Army abroad, they barely have enough men to keep the roads of the region safe.<ref>[[Deputy Rainer#Quotes]]</ref> At some point, [[Deputy Rainer]] requested more Stormwind soldiers from [[Marshal Dughan]] in [[Goldshire]], who instead sends [[Alliance]] [[adventurer]]s as reinforcements. With their help, the Garrison fought the [[Riverpaw pack]] who infested the woods south of the guard tower, as they couldn't handle them alone.<ref>{{Alliance}} [10] [[Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty]]</ref>

Several wanted posters at the garrison gave the mission to kill [[Hogger]], the chieftain of the Riverpaw gnolls who has overpowered all attempts at his capture.<ref>{{Alliance}} [11+] [[WANTED: "Hogger"]]</ref>

